<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CLASS INSIGHTS</view><view class="title">把全班表现，放在一起看</view><view class="subtitle">当前课堂 · 深蹲 · 按学生汇总</view><demo-notice/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="refresh">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在汇总…</view><block wx:if="{{stats}}"><view class="grid"><view class="card"><view class="muted">参与人数</view><view class="big">{{stats.total}}<text class="unit">人</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="muted">平均质量</view><view class="big">{{stats.average}}<text class="unit">分</text></view></view></view><view class="section">动作质量分布</view><view class="card"><training-chart model="{{distributionChart}}" height="380"/><view class="bar-row" wx:for="{{stats.buckets}}" wx:key="label"><view class="row"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="name">{{item.count}} 人</text></view><view class="track"><view class="fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"/></view></view><view class="hint">区间用于展示分布，不代表课程达标或健康评价标准。</view></view><view class="section">共性动作问题 <text class="section-note">人数 / 事件次数</text></view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{stats.issues}}" wx:key="code" class="list-row row"><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">需结合现场动作复核</view></view><text class="pill attention">{{item.people}} 人 · {{item.count}} 次</text></view><view wx:if="{{!stats.issues.length}}" class="empty">暂无动作事件</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="advice">查看教学建议与数据依据 →</button></block></view>
